/**
 * Credentials to connect to a pip repository. By default we do not use any username or password.
 * If you need to use a username and password, you can set it as follows:
 * ```js
 * PyPIRepositoryCredentials.setConfigValue("username", "pip-user", ConfigOverride.ENV);
 * PyPIRepositoryCredentials.setSecretValue("password", "pip-password", ConfigOverride.ENV);
 * ```
 * In the above examples, we use the override level ENV but you can choose any override level you want {@link ConfigOverride}.
 */
type PyPIRepositoryCredentials mixes Config, BasicCredentials, Singleton
